---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="消息"><section class="narrow-page"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">我的书房 / 消息</p><h1>文字有了回声</h1><p>回复、赞同与新相逢，都留在这里。</p></header><p data-guest-only><a href="/auth/?next=/notifications/">登录后查看消息 →</a></p><div data-auth-only hidden><div class="section-heading"><label>消息分类<select id="notification-filter"><option value="all">全部</option><option value="reply">回复</option><option value="like">点赞</option><option value="follow">关注</option><option value="system">系统</option></select></label><button id="read-all">全部标为已读</button></div><div id="notification-list" aria-live="polite"></div><button id="notification-more" hidden>查看更多消息</button></div></section></Layout>
